  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The order lookup response contains information about the `orderId` you specify when you call `Look-Up-Order-ID`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/orderId",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreserverapi/documentation/AppStoreServerAPI/Look-Up-Order-ID"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the `orderId` that you provide in the request is invalid, the response doesn’t include the `signedTransactions` array. If the `orderId` is valid, expect at least one transaction in the `signedTransactions` array.",
          "refs": []
        }
